<https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "The Virtual Brain Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> <http://purl.org/pav/version> "0.9.0" .
