<https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TVB-O" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvb-o-axioms.ttl> .
