<https://w3id.org/tvbo/annotations> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "annotations (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/annotations> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "annotations" .
