# https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated_over
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated_over> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated_over> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated_over> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "correlated_over (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated_over> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Which axis `covariance` indexes — `node` (equivalently `region`) for spatially correlated drive, or `state` for correlation between the noise on different state variables. Required whenever `covariance` is set: a covariance without a named axis does not identify a process. A multi-mode model carries its modes inside the state axis, so a modal covariance is declared over `state`." .
