# https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "coupling (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "coupling" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_evaluation
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "coupling_evaluation (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Backend-neutral numerical treatment of the network coupling term across the stages of a multi-stage integrator (Heun, RK4, ...): re-evaluated at every stage (per_stage, standard ODE accuracy) or computed once per step and held across the stages (per_step, the TVB scheme). A single-stage method (Euler) and a single node integrate the same system under both. tvboptim's native solvers, NetworkDynamics.jl and the jax backend honour both values, the jax backend per_stage over an undelayed coupling only; TVB and the Python graph runner integrate per_step and refuse per_stage, and tvboptim's diffrax solvers and PyRates always integrate per_stage, whatever is declared (CouplingStageEvaluation states each value's behaviour). per_stage is required to match reference integrators for stiff, chaotic or multistable systems, where the frozen-coupling error can select a different trajectory or attractor." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "coupling_evaluation" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_function
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_function> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coupling_function> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
