<https://w3id.org/tvbo/node_selection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Makes this network a subset by node of what it declares (``NodeSelection``): the nodes to keep or to drop, named by label. Everything else is as declared, so a network that includes another and adds a selection is that network without some of its nodes." .
