<https://w3id.org/tvbo/results> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The named numbers the prose cites, each keyed by the manuscript token that stands in for it (``key``) and bound either to a computed value (``used:`` a DataRef into this study's or a nested study's analysis) or to an authored constant quoted from prior work (``value`` + ``source``). ``tvbo run`` collects these into a results manifest the document reads, so no reported figure is transcribed by hand and a stale or missing key fails the build rather than printing a wrong number." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/results> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
