<https://w3id.org/tvbo/transforms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ordered list of transforms applied to edge property matrices. Each entry rewrites the edge property its `output:` names, else the one its `name:` is (e.g. 'weight', 'length'), and that property is also the value under transform inside the entry's own equation, which is written over the network's edge attributes. Supports equation-based (symbolic) or callable-based (software) transforms. Multiple transforms on the same target are applied sequentially, each seeing the previous one's output; since `name:` identifies an entry, each after the first states the target as its `output:`." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/transforms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/transforms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "transforms" .
