<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/template_variants> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Seeds that supersede ``template`` for one init variant, keyed by variant name. A file every study gets may still need different starting text once the variant says what kind of study this is — a replication's provenance note names a paper, and a general study has no paper to name — so stating only the difference keeps one entry per file rather than two that drift apart. The first selected variant naming a seed wins; absent means every variant starts from ``template``." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/template_variants> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/study> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/template_variants> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "template_variants" .
