<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One thing that was done: a solve, a fit, an analysis, a render. The PROV complement of ``Provenance``, which describes an artifact — an artifact is ``prov:wasGeneratedBy`` an Activity, and an Activity ``prov:used`` the artifacts and environment it consumed. Slot names follow BEP028's activity record (``Id``, ``Label``, ``Command``, ``AssociatedWith``, ``Used``, ``StartedAtTime``, ``EndedAtTime``) so a record in that vocabulary serializes to it without a translation table." .
