<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DistributionConfig> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DistributionConfig" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DistributionConfig> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Policy for mapping a parameter sweep's exploration axes onto the two parallelism tiers when rendering a distributed workflow. Vectorized axes are packed into a single batched backend call (e.g. vmap/pmap); workflow axes are fanned out into independent scheduler tasks, one per value combination. Backend-independent: the emitter validates that a requested vectorized axis is one the chosen backend can actually batch." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DistributionConfig> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DistributionConfig> .
