<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DomainEnforcement> <https://w3id.org/linkml/permissible_values> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DomainEnforcement#none> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DomainEnforcement> <https://w3id.org/linkml/permissible_values> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DomainEnforcement#wrap> .
