<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Edge> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An edge in a network. Three modes: explicit (source+target set, scalar parameters in YAML), template (no source/target, N×N matrix measure in HDF5), or produced (a `producer:` computes the whole matrix from the spec's own inputs, so no pre-built file is needed). All coexist in the same edges list." .
