<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GraphGenerator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Backend-agnostic graph generator specification.  Captures the mathematical family and its parameter declarations so that each backend can emit the correct constructor call (Graphs.jl, NetworkX, etc.) via per-backend ``bindings``; derived generators may also carry a symbolic ``procedure``.  The number of nodes is always taken from Network.number_of_nodes.\n" .
