<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Inset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Inset" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Inset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A sub-axes that draws exactly as a panel does — same kinds, layers, opts, annotations — minus the things only a mosaic cell has (a panel letter, a placeholder, a position in the layout). One class for both an inset and a grid cell, so a cell cannot behave unlike the inset beside it; they differ only in who positions them." .
