<https://w3id.org/tvbo/NamedArray> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A named numeric array. Used as a sidecar slot value where a schema-typed object (e.g. ``ExperimentResult.parameters``) holds multiple arrays addressable by name (``w_LRE``, ``w_FFI``, ``J_i``, ...). The actual numeric data lives in the companion ``.h5`` at ``parameters/<name>``; the YAML carries only the descriptor." .
