<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Observation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Unified class for all observation/measurement specifications. Covers monitors (BOLD, EEG), tuning observables, and derived quantities. Pipeline is a sequence of Functions with input -> output flow." .
