<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Partition" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A grouped streaming reduction over a node partition (e.g. per-hemisphere cortical wave metrics): the per-timestep observer body is evaluated ONCE for a single group and vmapped over the partition axis, and the per-group outputs are folded to per-group scalar metrics. General in its group-vmap (``gather`` + ``over``); the metric roles (``waves`` / ``directed`` / ``correlation``) name the per-group derived variables the wave finalize reduces to proportion-of-waves, proportion-directed and the median flow–instrength correlation (rho)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Partition> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Partition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
