_:genid3332 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#maxCardinality> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
_:genid3332 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/license> .
