<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reducer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reducer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reducer" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reducer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A streaming reduction, authored as symbolic recurrences over its own state rather than as backend code. Folded into the integrator carry so a windowed observable (a sliding-window FC, a running mean) is computed without ever materialising the trajectory. `add` folds an arriving sample in, `evict` takes a leaving one back out, `resync` rebuilds the state exactly from the window when incremental drift would accumulate, and `emit` reads the reduced value out. TVBO lowers all four through the sympy printers, so no backend ships a reducer and adding one is a YAML file rather than code." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reducer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reducer> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reducer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
