<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ResultBinding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ResultBinding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ResultBinding" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ResultBinding> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One entry in a study's results manifest: a manuscript key bound to the value it stands for. Exactly one of three forms: COMPUTED FROM A RUN — ``used:`` a DataRef reading a scalar out of a nested study's or this study's own analysis/experiment, formatted through ``format`` — COMPUTED FROM THE SPEC — ``count:`` a structural tally of a collection (e.g. the figures a nested study regenerates), needing no run — or AUTHORED — a literal ``value`` quoted from prior work and attributed by ``source``. So a number printed in prose is computed or an authored constant marked as such, never transcribed by hand." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ResultBinding> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ResultBinding> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ResultBinding> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
