<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Surrogate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A permutation-significance test: re-evaluate a named statistic under n_perm fixed permutations of a field and report the per-element exceedance p-value. General (any permutation null — spatial nulls, FC significance, wave detection, …). Codegen emits ``(vmap(lambda p: stat(field[p]))(perms) <cmp> stat(field)).mean(axis over perms)``; the wrapped statistic is an ordinary symbolic derived variable, so only the permutation fold is structural." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Surrogate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Surrogate> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Surrogate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
