<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WorkflowConfig> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WorkflowConfig> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "WorkflowConfig" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WorkflowConfig> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Declarative orchestration for rendering a parameter sweep into a distributed, reproducible workflow (Slurm array, Snakemake, Nextflow). Backend- and engine-independent: it names *what* to distribute, *where* results go, and the per-engine resources, while each engine emitter renders the concrete artefact. Declared on a study as ``workflow`` and refined per experiment via ``workflow_overrides``; unset fields fall back to the emitter's defaults so an override sets only what it names." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WorkflowConfig> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/WorkflowConfig> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WorkflowConfig> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
