<https://w3id.org/tvbo/MarkType#errorbar> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One vertical bar per x between two edges (a group's mean ± SD at each discrete group). The data contract of `band`, drawn as separate segments, because a band filled between discrete groups implies values between them that were never measured." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/MarkType#errorbar> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "errorbar" .
