<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#vmap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#vmap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vmap (ParallelMode)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#vmap> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Parallel batched execution (jax.vmap). Fast; high peak memory." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#vmap> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "vmap" .
