<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SamplingAxis#trial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "trial (SamplingAxis)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SamplingAxis#trial> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sample over space once per trial of an `n_trials` ensemble: each trial starts from its own draw, keyed as the run's draw with the trial index folded in. Outside an ensemble it is the run's draw, as under `space`." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SamplingAxis#trial> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "trial" .
