# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "stage (SelectionScope)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Each stage keeps its own best iterate and restores it before the next stage starts, so every stage restarts from the best state the previous one found; the run records one iteration and value per stage. This is the authors' released feedback-inhibition protocol, where each stage was a separate process that restarted from the previous stage's best checkpoint." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "stage" .
