<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SweepDirection#down> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "down (SweepDirection)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SweepDirection#down> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Decrease the parameter monotonically (high to low), once." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SweepDirection#down> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "down" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/SweepDirection#up
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SweepDirection#up> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
