<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityGHK> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#channelDensityGHK> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityGHK> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "permeability" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityGHK> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/requires> "caConc" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityGHK> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/requires> "caConcExt" .
