<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityGHK2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#channelDensityGHK2> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityGHK2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/requires> "caConc" .
