# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityNernstCa2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityNernstCa2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityNernstCa2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/baseChannelDensityCond> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityNernstCa2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This component is similar to the original component type _channelDensityNernst_ but it is changed in order to have a reversal potential that depends on a second independent Ca++ pool (ca2). See https://github.com/OpenSourceBrain/ghk-nernst."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/channelDensityNernstCa2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
