<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "To enable connections between populations through gap junctions. Populations need to be of type _populationList_ and contain _instance_ and _location_ elements."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "electricalConnectionInstance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#electricalConnectionInstance> .
