# https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstanceW
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstanceW> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstanceW> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstance> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstanceW> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "To enable connections between populations through gap junctions. Populations need to be of type _populationList_ and contain _instance_ and _location_ elements. Includes setting of _weight for the connection"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/electricalConnectionInstanceW> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
