# https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expOneSynapse
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expOneSynapse> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expOneSynapse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/baseConductanceBasedSynapse> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expOneSynapse> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ohmic synapse model whose conductance rises instantaneously by (_gbase * _weight) on receiving an event, and which decays exponentially to zero with time course _tauDecay"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expOneSynapse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
