<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expOneSynapse> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "tauDecay" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expThreeSynapse
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expThreeSynapse> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expThreeSynapse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/baseConductanceBasedSynapseTwo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expThreeSynapse> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ohmic synapse similar to expTwoSynapse but consisting of two components that can differ in decay times and max conductances but share the same rise time."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/expThreeSynapse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
