<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/intracellularProperties> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#intracellularProperties> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/intracellularProperties> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/exposes> "caConc" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/intracellularProperties> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/exposes> "caConcExt" .
