<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/point3DWithDiam> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "diameter" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/point3DWithDiam> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "x" .
