<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Voltage clamp with 3 clamp levels. Applies a variable current _i (through _simpleSeriesResistance) to try to keep parent cell at _conditioningVoltage until time _delay, _testingVoltage until _delay + _duration, and _returnVoltage afterwards. Only enabled if _active = 1. "@en .
