<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/StudyDirectory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StudyDirectory (study)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/StudyDirectory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One directory in a study layout. ``role`` is the stable key code resolves by: a resolver asks the layout where the ``results`` go and never for a literal path, so moving a directory is a one-line edit to this record. ``bids`` states the directory's standing with the standard, which is what decides whether it needs a ``.bidsignore`` entry, and ``tracked`` states what version control keeps." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/StudyDirectory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/study> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/StudyDirectory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "StudyDirectory" .
