<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/StudyTemplate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StudyTemplate (study)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/StudyTemplate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One kind of study the layout accounts for. A template is a *specialisation*: it names the entries a kind adds to the study every kind already shares, and nothing else. The general study is therefore not a template and names none — a kind earns an entry here only once some directory or file genuinely belongs to it and not to the rest." .
