<https://w3id.org/tvbo/sw/ToolUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/sw/ToolUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ToolUnit (sw)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/sw/ToolUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One TVBO unit as a single tool writes it.\nA tool's unit vocabulary is a fact about that tool, not about the unit — LEMS calls `Hz` a `per_time` quantity and writes it `per_s`, and no other backend need agree. Keyed by the `UnitEnum` value so a record states only the units its tool knows." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/sw/ToolUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/sw> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/sw/ToolUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ToolUnit" .
