# https://w3id.org/tvbo/StaticDelayBuffer
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StaticDelayBuffer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StaticDelayBuffer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/BackendCapability> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StaticDelayBuffer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fixed-length delay-history buffer (ceil(max_delay/dt) steps) whose size is set by an explicit max_delay bound and decoupled from the (possibly varying / traced) per-edge delays — the prerequisite for varying or differentiating delays under JIT. Delays exceeding max_delay are truncated (saturated at max_delay), so the bound must cover the slowest conduction speed explored."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StaticDelayBuffer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StaticDelayBuffer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Static delay history buffer"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StaticDelayBuffer> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/boundConstraint> "max_delay >= max(tract_length) / min(conduction_speed)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StaticDelayBuffer> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/enabledByGraphParameter> "max_delay" .
