<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coordinate_spaces/fsaverage> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "FreeSurfer's fsaverage template (Fischl, Sereno, Tootell and Dale, 1999, https://doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-0193(1999)8:4<272::AID-HBM10>3.0.CO;2-4), chiefly a surface template: TemplateFlow ships it as surface meshes per hemisphere at densities 3k, 10k, 41k and 164k (`tpl-fsaverage_hemi-L_den-164k_midthickness.surf.gii` and others), with a 1 mm T1w volume and a brain mask (`tpl-fsaverage_res-01_T1w.nii.gz`, `tpl-fsaverage_res-01_desc-brain_mask.nii.gz`). TemplateFlow id: `tpl-fsaverage`. Its name and reference are TemplateFlow's `template_description.json` (https://github.com/templateflow/tpl-fsaverage/blob/master/template_description.json), which lists no authors." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/coordinate_spaces/fsaverage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
