<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/TBPTT_JansenRit_FC_Optimization> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Truncated backprop-through-time for a chaotic Jansen-Rit network. Fits global coupling G to empirical FC; contrasts full-BPTT vs windowed (grad_horizon) gradients. Based on tvboptim TBPTT.qmd.\n" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/TBPTT_JansenRit_FC_Optimization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/TBPTT_JansenRit_FC_Optimization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TBPTT Jansen-Rit FC Fitting" .
