<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Chua> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Chua/parameters/b> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Chua> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Chua/parameters/m0> .
