<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/IkedaMap> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/IkedaMap/parameters/a> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/IkedaMap> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/IkedaMap/parameters/b> .
