<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/MagneticPendulum> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Damped planar magnetic pendulum over N fixed magnets forming a symmetric multistable\npotential. Exhibits fractal basin boundaries and sensitive dependence in final magnet\nattraction region selection." .
