# https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/g
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(g, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(-0.01*(g - 0.1*x1))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Lowpass-filtered excitatory coupling variable." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
