<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "g" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x1, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(y1 - z + Iext_total + Kvf*c_glob0 + f1*x1)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state variable of the first (fast) population." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x1 (Epileptor state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x2, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(-y2 + x2 - x2**3 + Iext2 + bb*g - 0.3*(z - 3.5) + Kf*c_glob1)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state variable of the second (slow) population." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
