# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "h" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((x0 + 3.0/(exp((-x1 - 1*0.5)/0.1) + 1.0), modification > 0), (zcond + 4*(-x0 + x1), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
