# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "xs" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((2*(cardano_a**2 - cardano_d)**(1/6)*cos(atan2(sqrt(-cardano_d), cardano_a)/3), cardano_d < 0), (Piecewise(((cardano_a + sqrt(cardano_d))**(1/3), (cardano_a + sqrt(cardano_d)) >= 0), (Abs(cardano_a + sqrt(cardano_d))**(1/3)/2, True)) + Piecewise(((cardano_a - sqrt(cardano_d))**(1/3), (cardano_a - sqrt(cardano_d)) >= 0), (Abs(cardano_a - sqrt(cardano_d))**(1/3)/2, True)), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The x-coordinate of the resting state (branch N=1), the real part of the Cardano root of xs**3 - mu2*xs - mu1 = 0, reproducing TVB's principal-branch complex cube root. For negative discriminant (three real roots) the trigonometric form is used; for non-negative discriminant the principal-branch real cube root sum is used (a real cube root for non-negative argument, half the real cube root of the magnitude for negative argument)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "xs (EpileptorCodim3 derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "xs" .
