<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/y> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/y> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(y, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/y> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "x**3 - mu2*x - mu1 - y*(nu + b*x + x**2)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/y> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Fast subsystem variable y." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/y> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
