# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(z, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "-c*(sqrt((x - xs)**2 + y**2) - dstar + Piecewise(((z - 1/2)**7/10, modification > 0), (0, True)) + Ks*c_glob)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Slow subsystem variable z steering the fast subsystem along the great arc." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "z (EpileptorCodim3 state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorCodim3/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "z" .
