<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/EpileptorRestingState/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(Iext + Kvf*c_glob0 + local_coupling*x1 + x1*x1cond + y1 - z)" .
