<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/gamma> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Constant parameter to reproduce FHN dynamics where                excitatory input currents are negative" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/gamma> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
