<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/tau> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A time-scale hierarchy can be introduced for the state         variables :math:`V` and :math:`W`" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/tau> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Generic2dOscillator/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
