<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Gissinger/parameters/mu> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.119"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Gissinger/parameters/mu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
