<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/JansenRit/derived_variables/sigma_y1_y2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Sigmoid function that transforms the average membrane potential of the interneurons populations (y1-y2)\ninto an average firing rate to the PCs." .
