<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "-W_e/tau_w_e + b_e*E + a_e*(muV_e - E_L_e)/tau_w_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Adaptation current of the excitatory population [pA]." .
