# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-MEGAlpha_dscalar
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-MEGAlpha_dscalar> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-MEGAlpha_dscalar> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Network> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-MEGAlpha_dscalar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Per-region MEG alpha-band amplitude values aligned with the 68 cortical parcels\nof the Desikan-Killiany atlas. Sourced from\ntvb-ontology-optim-workshop/notebooks/data/{lh,rh}_megalpha_parc.csv.\n\nThe measure exhibits the canonical cortical-hierarchy gradient:\n  - unimodal sensory regions (pericalcarine, cuneus, lateraloccipital,\n    transversetemporal) score high  (~0.40)\n  - transmodal regions       (rostralanteriorcingulate, frontalpole,\n    temporalpole, medialorbitofrontal) score low (~0.15)\n\nUsed as a per-region cortical-gradient signal in experiments that need\nto ground a hierarchy (e.g. reservoir-computing frequency-gradient\ntargets, JR-MEG peak-frequency optimisation). The values are\ndimensionless normalised amplitudes; downstream consumers rescale\nto a task-appropriate range (e.g. omega in Hz).\n" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-MEGAlpha_dscalar> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-MEGAlpha_dscalar> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tpl-fsaverage_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-MEGAlpha_dscalar" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-MEGAlpha_dscalar> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Desikan-Killiany 68 cortical parcels with MEG alpha amplitudes per region" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Network> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Lobar8 parcellation on both hemispheres of FreeSurfer's fsaverage, left then right, the right's triangles offset by the left's vertex count: TemplateFlow's `tpl-fsaverage_hemi-L|R_den-164k_pial.surf.gii`, each vertex taking the lobe of its Desikan-Killiany region in `tpl-fsaverage_hemi-L|R_den-164k_atlas-Desikan2006_seg-aparc_desc-curated_dseg.label.gii` by `DK_REGION_TO_LOBE` in `scripts/create_lobar8_surface.py` and indexing the 16 nodes of its parent network. Normals are each vertex's sum of its triangles' cross products, normalised. A medial-wall vertex takes the lobe of the nearest labelled vertex of its hemisphere, where the hemisphere surfaces keep it -1. The arrays are as commit 2766c501b wrote them." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lobar8 surface (fsaverage 164k, 327684 vertices)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsaverage_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_den-164k_desc-surf_relmat/parameters/conduction_speed> .
