# https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Observation> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Records the afferent (incoming) coupling term at each network node at every integration step. Records the coupling input that drives the dynamics rather than the model state itself." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AfferentCoupling" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling_temporal_average
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling_temporal_average> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling_temporal_average> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Observation> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling_temporal_average> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Temporally averaged afferent coupling input at each node. Combines coupling input recording with temporal averaging." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/afferent_coupling_temporal_average> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
