# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_balloon
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_balloon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_balloon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Observation> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_balloon> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "BOLD fMRI observation model using the Balloon-Windkessel hemodynamic ODE, co-integrated with the model rather than applied to a stored trajectory. Vasodilatory signal, blood inflow, blood volume and deoxyhaemoglobin advance alongside the neural state, and the BOLD signal is emitted at each TR, so peak memory is O(nodes) instead of O(time x nodes)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_balloon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_balloon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BOLD_Balloon" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/HemodynamicObservation> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Observation> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "BOLD fMRI observation model using a Double Exponential hemodynamic response function." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BOLD_DoubleExponential" .
