# https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_gamma
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_gamma> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_gamma> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/HemodynamicObservation> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_gamma> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Observation> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_gamma> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "BOLD fMRI observation model using a Gamma-shaped hemodynamic response function. Provides a simpler, unimodal HRF shape." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_gamma> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_gamma> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BOLD_Gamma" .
