<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_region_roi> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_region_roi/parameters/hrf_length> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_tvb
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_tvb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_tvb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Observation> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_tvb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "BOLD fMRI observation model using the Balloon-Windkessel hemodynamic model. Transforms neural activity into simulated BOLD signal via convolution with a hemodynamic response function (First Order Volterra kernel), followed by a nonlinear Volterra transformation." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_tvb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
