<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/temporal_average_tvb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Running temporal mean over non-overlapping windows of `period`, windowed exactly as TVB's TemporalAverage monitor windows: the first window covers integration steps 0..istep-1, and `istep` is TVB's own `iround(period / dt)`. Verified against TVB's own monitor driven through its `sample()` loop." .
