<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/sPyNNaker> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Software stack enabling PyNN models to execute on the SpiNNaker neuromorphic computing platform. Translates PyNN network descriptions into configurations for SpiNNaker's many-core ARM processors." .
