# https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/vbjax
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/vbjax> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/vbjax> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/sw/SimulationTool> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/vbjax> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "JAX-based virtual brain library. Provides stochastic Heun integrators for ODE/SDE/DDE/SDDE, canonical neural-mass models (Jansen-Rit, Montbrio-Pazo-Roxin, BVEP, bilinear DCM, Dopa), BOLD/EEG monitors, delay-coupling helpers, a spherical-harmonic neural-field operator, and JAX-native parameter sweeps with gradient-based fitting and MCMC." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/vbjax> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "Apache-2.0" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/software/vbjax> <http://schema.org/codeRepository> "https://github.com/ins-amu/vbjax" .
