<https://w3id.org/tvbo/auto_format> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Whether this figure's axes follow a theme's axis rule. `false` leaves every axis exactly as its panels drew it, whatever the study's theme says: no tick re-placed, no limit moved, no spine detached or trimmed, no labels aligned. `true` draws it by the curated `tvbo:themes/bsplot` rule wherever neither its own theme nor its study's states one. Unset follows the theme." .
