<https://w3id.org/tvbo/backend> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/backend> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "backend (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/backend> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Execution backend this experiment runs on when no backend is passed explicitly (e.g. 'tvboptim', 'tvb', 'jax', 'julia', 'brian2'). Declares the engine the experiment requires — a spiking point-neuron network sets 'brian2', a mean-field model leaves it unset. run(format=...) and ``tvbo run --backend`` override it; when unset the default backend (tvboptim) is used." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/backend> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
