<https://w3id.org/tvbo/concept_iri> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Cognitive Atlas IRI of the cognitive construct measured (e.g. ``cogat:trm_521ef89ce5e84`` for fluid intelligence)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/concept_iri> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/concept_iri> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "concept_iri" .
