<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_parameters> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Parameter symbols accessible in the condition function." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_parameters> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
