# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "condition_states (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "State variable symbols accessible in the condition function. For edges, can include source/destination vertex outputs." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "condition_states" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectivity_ref> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectivity_ref> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "connectivity_ref (slot)" .
