<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectivity_ref> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectivity_ref> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "connectivity_ref" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
