<https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Deprecated. Whether the noise is correlated, without saying across which axis or by how much. Use `covariance` + `correlated_over`." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "correlated" .
