<https://w3id.org/tvbo/how_to_acknowledge> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "howToAcknowledge" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/how_to_acknowledge> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sentences that anyone who reuses the artifact must reproduce, one per source that requires one. The meaning of the BIDS `dataset_description.json` field `HowToAcknowledge` (instructions to reusers), never of BIDS `Acknowledgements` (the producer's own thanks); a BIDS export joins the entries into that one field. A step that derives an artifact carries over the entries of every input it read." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/how_to_acknowledge> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/how_to_acknowledge> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "how_to_acknowledge" .
