<https://w3id.org/tvbo/number> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The panel letter to draw, overriding the mosaic key, or the string 'false' to draw none. Needed whenever the paper's panels do not map one-to-one onto mosaic cells: a row of five mode surfaces under a single (a), or a schematic cell that carries no letter of its own. Without it a grouped figure numbers every cell and its letters stop matching the paper's." .
