<https://w3id.org/tvbo/number_of_modes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Length of the mode axis every state variable carries (TVB's ``number_of_modes``): the same equations evaluated once per mode, the modes differing only through per-mode parameter vectors and mixing through mode-coupling matrices (``mode_dot``), as in the Stefanescu–Jirsa reduced sets. Distinct from ``components``, which nests different dynamics." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/number_of_modes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
