<https://w3id.org/tvbo/parent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The network parameter giving each entry of this vocabulary its parent, an entry of a coarser vocabulary: it holds one code per entry of this one, each a code into the vocabulary its own ``levels`` names, or ``-1`` for an entry with no parent. Declares a hierarchy of vocabularies, such as the regions of an atlas within its lobes. A name no network parameter carries, one without ``levels``, a count of codes other than this vocabulary's entry count, and a code outside the parent vocabulary are refused when the network is resolved." .
