<https://w3id.org/tvbo/share_x> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Panel groups that share one x scale, each entry a comma-separated list of mosaic keys ('c,g,h'). Every panel in a group ends on the union of the group's limits. Declare it whenever a panel's tick labels are hidden as another panel's: hiding them alone asserts a shared scale the axes do not actually have, and a reader then compares two panels drawn at different ranges." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/share_x> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/share_x> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "share_x" .
# 
