<https://w3id.org/tvbo/share_y> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Panel groups that share one y scale, each entry a comma-separated list of mosaic keys ('c,g,h'). Same rule as share_x." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/share_y> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/share_y> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "share_y" .
