<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_regions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Regions a stimulus-type event targets: 'all' (broadcast to every node) or explicit region labels / indices. More expressive than the integer-only `regions` slot; when both are absent the event applies to all regions." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_regions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_regions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "target_regions" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_var> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
