<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_var> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Input variable on target node to connect to (e.g., 'c_in'). If not specified, uses first coupling input from target dynamics. The alias `target_variable` is accepted." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_var> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_var> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "target_var" .
