<https://w3id.org/tvbo/text> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "text (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/text> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The label. With `used:` it is a Python format string applied to the referenced value, e.g. 'r = {:.2f}'." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/text> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .
