<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ticklabels> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Text for the marked values of a STANDALONE `kind: colorbar` panel, where the numbers themselves are not what the figure wants to print. A bar attached to a panel writes its own numbers, which the shared format pass rounds to `decimals`." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ticklabels> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .
