# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/trim_margins> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/trim_margins> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "trim_margins (slot)" .
